# The bitten (docs/DIALOGUE.md, "The bitten, the clock and what you carry"). [Bitten] topics show only
# while the HUD shows a bite. Telling a safehouse is its own built service; nothing here reads whether
# a cleaned bite took. Saying you're not bitten while it shows is a lie, and its tell is the symptoms.

conv occupant.bitten.declare
for occupant
when bite_shown & !declared
topic "[Bitten] Tell them about the bite."
prio quest
voice haven

node start
  say "Show me. Go on. Nobody here is going to shout."
  > @tell "Here. It's a bite." -> told   do call:declare_bite
  > @fine "It's nothing. A scratch off a fence." -> fine | caught   check lie haven 2   truth !bite_shown   found nset:hid_bite
  > @back "Not now." -> hub

node told
  say "Thank you for saying it out loud. Most don't. Sit by the door, where it's cooler."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node fine
  say "A fence. Right. Keep it covered, then, and keep it clean."
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

node caught
  say "That's not a fence. I've seen enough of them now. Let me write it down, at least."
  do call:caught_bite
  > @tell2 "All right. Write it down." -> told   do call:declare_bite
  > @back3 "Leave it." -> hub

conv occupant.bitten.found
for occupant
when nmem:hid_bite
greet
prio reaction
once
voice haven

node start
  say "You told us it was a fence. It wasn't. Next time, say it at the door. We'd have helped."

conv halcyon.bitten.trial
for leader:halcyon, named:halcyon
when bite_shown
topic "[Bitten] Ask about the trial dose."
prio quest
voice halcyon

node start
  say "There is a trial dose. It is a trial. We record everything, including you."
  say "Ask at the lab gate's table. Bring the bite while it's young. Older bites are less interesting to us, and to you."
  > @consent "What do I sign?" -> sign
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node sign
  say "Name, time of bite, consent. The form is short. We are told that is a kindness."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv wanderer.doctor.symptoms
for wanderer:doctor
when !bite_shown & stage:fever
topic "[Fever] Ask what this is."
prio quest
voice plain

node start
  say "Look at me. Eyes. Hands. ...That isn't a bite. That's a fever, and an ordinary one, probably."
  say "Water, rest, and stop running everywhere. If it's still there tomorrow, find a house with a medic."
  > @sure "Probably?" -> probably
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node probably
  say "Everything's probably now. It's the best word we've got left."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv occupant.nurse.symptoms
for occupant
when house:short & bg:nurse,doctor
topic "[Nurse] Ask who's coughing."
prio world
voice haven

node start
  say "The little one at the back. Coughing since the school trip."
  say (her father) "It's her chest. It's always been her chest. I keep telling them."
  say "People look at her like she's bitten. She isn't. Is she?"
  > @chest "That isn't a bite. It's her chest." -> chest   if bg:nurse,doctor
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node chest
  say "Say it again, louder, at supper. They'll listen to you. They don't listen to him."
  do learn:house.cough@here
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub
